            "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/original/3X/8/6/866b13f3a52d05c5fedbe01e810bbcf3bf433c7e.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/jb7osj6RVJDPoWdWiUwkYKZA6Ps.png?dl=1\" title=\"▶️ My workflow 3 - n8n - Neo 8_16_2026 6_00_49 PM\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/8/6/866b13f3a52d05c5fedbe01e810bbcf3bf433c7e_2_690x387.png\" alt=\"▶️ My workflow 3 - n8n - Neo 8_16_2026 6_00_49 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"jb7osj6RVJDPoWdWiUwkYKZA6Ps\" width=\"690\" height=\"387\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/8/6/866b13f3a52d05c5fedbe01e810bbcf3bf433c7e_2_690x387.png, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/8/6/866b13f3a52d05c5fedbe01e810bbcf3bf433c7e_2_1035x580.png 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/8/6/866b13f3a52d05c5fedbe01e810bbcf3bf433c7e_2_1380x774.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1D1C1D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">▶️ My workflow 3 - n8n - Neo 8_16_2026 6_00_49 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1078 141 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/original/3X/c/2/c2550675da1d5c3f30a7039070a679741ffc6a4a.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/rJ8NhXtOTNHHZkWPRHc7IgfZNkC.png?dl=1\" title=\"⚠️ My workflow 3 - n8n - Neo 8_23_2026 1_57_38 PM\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/c/2/c2550675da1d5c3f30a7039070a679741ffc6a4a_2_690x387.png\" alt=\"⚠️ My workflow 3 - n8n - Neo 8_23_2026 1_57_38 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"rJ8NhXtOTNHHZkWPRHc7IgfZNkC\" width=\"690\" height=\"387\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/c/2/c2550675da1d5c3f30a7039070a679741ffc6a4a_2_690x387.png, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/c/2/c2550675da1d5c3f30a7039070a679741ffc6a4a_2_1035x580.png 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/c/2/c2550675da1d5c3f30a7039070a679741ffc6a4a_2_1380x774.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1C1B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">⚠️ My workflow 3 - n8n - Neo 8_23_2026 1_57_38 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1078 114 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Hey everyone! <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/waving_hand.png?v=15\" title=\":waving_hand:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":waving_hand:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I’m a beginner AI automation developer focused on building practical workflows with <strong>n8n, AI/LLM APIs, webhooks, REST APIs, CRM/Google Sheets integrations, and Python</strong>.</p>\n<p>I’m currently looking to work with an <strong>AI automation agency, startup, or business owner</strong> where I can contribute to real projects, learn from production environments, and grow into a strong automation engineer.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/brain.png?v=15\" title=\":brain:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":brain:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> What I can work with:</p>\n<p>• n8n workflow automation<br>\n• Webhooks &amp; REST APIs<br>\n• OpenAI / LLM integrations<br>\n• AI classification &amp; qualification<br>\n• Lead routing and processing<br>\n• Google Sheets / CRM workflows<br>\n• Structured AI outputs<br>\n• Conditional logic &amp; branching<br>\n• Human approval workflows<br>\n• Notifications and automated follow-ups<br>\n• Data extraction, transformation &amp; validation<br>\n• Basic Python<br>\n• Testing, debugging and workflow troubleshooting</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/building_construction.png?v=15\" title=\":building_construction:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":building_construction:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> How I think about workflows:</p>\n<p>TRIGGER → INPUT/VALIDATION → PROCESSING → AI DECISION → TOOLS/API CALLS → CONDITIONAL LOGIC → HUMAN APPROVAL → ACTION → CRM/DATABASE → NOTIFICATION → LOGGING → ERROR HANDLING</p>\n<p>I’m not just interested in connecting random nodes together. I’m learning to think about the complete workflow, including what happens when APIs fail, data is missing, an AI response is incorrect, or a human needs to take over.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/fire.png?v=15\" title=\":fire:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":fire:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Projects I’ve personally built:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/one.png?v=15\" title=\":one:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":one:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> AI Lead Qualification System</p>\n<p>• Lead enters through a form/webhook<br>\n• AI analyzes and qualifies the lead<br>\n• Structured result is generated<br>\n• Result is stored in Google Sheets/CRM<br>\n• Salesperson receives a notification</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/two.png?v=15\" title=\":two:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":two:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> AI Local Prospecting Agent</p>\n<p>• Takes a target location<br>\n• Finds local businesses<br>\n• Researches potential prospects<br>\n• Qualifies whether they may need a service<br>\n• Generates personalized outreach<br>\n• Requires human approval before sending<br>\n• Logs the results</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/three.png?v=15\" title=\":three:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":three:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> AI Local Lead Hunter</p>\n<p>I’m currently extending my prospecting system into a more complete lead-hunting workflow with research, qualification, personalization, approval and logging.(in progress)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/robot.png?v=15\" title=\":robot:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":robot:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> AI Voice / Telephony</p>\n<p>I have not yet built production systems with Retell, Vapi or Twilio, so I don’t want to pretend otherwise.</p>\n<p>However, I understand the architecture behind these systems and how they connect with n8n, APIs, CRMs, calendars, lead qualification, notifications and human handoff.</p>\n<p>I’m actively learning these areas and would be excited to work on them under real project requirements.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/bullseye.png?v=15\" title=\":bullseye:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":bullseye:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> What I’m looking for:</p>\n<p>• Remote freelance work<br>\n• Part-time opportunities<br>\n• Junior automation roles<br>\n• Long-term agency collaboration<br>\n• AI automation projects<br>\n• Opportunities where I can contribute technically and keep improving</p>\n<p>I’m especially interested in working with people who care about:</p>\n<p>BUILD → TEST → DEPLOY → MONITOR → MAINTAIN</p>\n<p>rather than simply making a workflow that works once.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/briefcase.png?v=15\" title=\":briefcase:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":briefcase:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> What I can bring:</p>\n<p>I’m comfortable learning unfamiliar APIs/tools, understanding an existing workflow, debugging problems, building from documentation, and improving workflows step by step.</p>\n<p>I’m also happy to start with a <strong>small technical task or demo</strong> so you can see how I work before committing to anything larger.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/envelope_with_arrow.png?v=15\" title=\":envelope_with_arrow:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":envelope_with_arrow:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> If you’re building an AI automation agency, hiring an n8n developer, or need help building reliable n8n + AI workflows, feel free to comment or DM me.</p>\n<p>I can share my projects, workflow screenshots, demos, and explain exactly what I personally built.</p>\n<p>Looking forward to connecting with people building interesting things! <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/rocket.png?v=15\" title=\":rocket:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rocket:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
